# The dataset is generated inside the image (Dockerfile.demo runs the
# generator), so a local copy is just build-context weight. Excluding the whole
# directory also keeps a stale -wal from riding along next to a checkpointed
# .db, which is how a "why is the demo missing entries" afternoon starts.
demo/data
